# Force LF in the working tree for every text file.
#
# PHPCS's WordPress standard rejects CRLF line endings ("End of line character
# is invalid"), and on Windows `core.autocrlf=true` hands out CRLF on checkout —
# including the temporary checkout lint-staged performs during the pre-commit
# hook, which made the hook fail on files that are perfectly fine on disk.
# Pinning eol=lf here overrides autocrlf for this repo, so the hook and CI see
# the same bytes on every machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.eot  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
